  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/infrastructure.html#dom-trees:hide-popover-algorithm\r\n\r\nWhen a popover is removed from the DOM, it calls the [hide popover algorithm](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/popover.html#hide-popover-algorithm).\r\n\r\nThat algorithm will always exit on step 1, since the removed element is no longer connected to the document.",
